---
import "../../style.css";
import "../../../rocket-star/design.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#020407" />
  <meta name="description" content="rocketstar: a two-stage reusable rocket design for small satellites, with A-LINK communications and RockstarOS operations." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="rocketstar — To Orbit. Back for More." />
  <meta property="og:description" content="A two-stage reusable rocket concept for small satellites, with A-LINK communications and RockstarOS operations." />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/rocket-star/" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
  <link rel="canonical" href="https://avocado-mini.kirin-999.chatgpt.site/rocket-star/" />
  <title>rocketstar — To Orbit. Back for More.</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" type="image/png" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/avokado-brand.css" />
  <script src="../../../rocket-star/main.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/site-enhancements.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="rocket-page launch-page">
  <a class="skip" href="#launch">Skip to rocketstar</a>
  <nav class="rocket-nav launch-nav" aria-label="rocketstar navigation">
    <a class="rocket-brand" href="/rocket-star/"><img class="rocketstar-mark" src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" />rocketstar</a>
    <a class="rocket-nav-back avokado-nav-back" href="/"><img class="avokado-brand-icon" src="/images/avokado-metallic-mark.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" />avokado <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section id="launch" class="launch-scroll" aria-labelledby="launch-title">
      <div class="launch-sticky">
        <div class="launch-cinematic-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="launch-space" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="launch-atmosphere" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="launch-horizon" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="launch-ground" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="launch-pad" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="launch-smoke" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <span class="launch-word" aria-hidden="true">STAR</span>

        <div class="launch-vehicle" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/images/rocket-star-launch-vehicle.png" alt="" fetchpriority="high" />
          <span class="launch-flame"></span>
          <span class="launch-glow"></span>
        </div>

        <div class="launch-panels">
          <article class="launch-panel launch-panel-purpose is-active" data-stage="0" aria-hidden="false">
            <p class="rocket-kicker">ROCKETSTAR / REUSABLE LAUNCH</p>
            <h1 id="launch-title">To orbit.<br>Back for more.</h1>
            <p>A two-stage reusable rocket design for small satellites. Deliver the payload to low Earth orbit. Bring both stages home. Prepare the same vehicles to fly again.</p>
            <div class="rocketstar-facts" aria-label="Mission design"><span>Small satellites</span><span>Both stages recovered</span><span>Uncrewed</span></div>
            <a class="rocketstar-design-link rocketstar-primary-document" href="/rocket-star/design/">Complete product design <span>Read all 35 chapters</span></a>
            <p class="rocketstar-caption">Design R1.0 · Flight and reuse not yet demonstrated.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="launch-panel launch-panel-system" data-stage="1">
            <p class="rocket-kicker">A-LINK / SATELLITE COMMUNICATIONS</p>
            <h2>From orbit.<br>To avokado.</h2>
            <p>The rocket returns. A-LINK satellites are planned to stay in orbit, relaying messages and small data between ground gateways and compatible avokado receivers.</p>
            <ol class="rocketstar-link" aria-label="Planned communication path"><li>Ground gateway</li><li>A-LINK satellite</li><li>avokado receiver</li></ol>
            <p class="rocketstar-caption">Reception needs coverage and a suitable antenna. Indoors may require an outdoor receiver. avokado mini R5 integration is in development.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="launch-panel launch-panel-foundation" data-stage="2">
            <p class="rocket-kicker">ROCKSTAROS / OPERATIONS FOUNDATION</p>
            <h2>One foundation.<br>Beyond Earth.</h2>
            <p>RockstarOS is designed to connect mission records, permissions, maintenance and communications — with a path toward future colony operations. Flight and critical equipment keep dedicated local controllers.</p>
            <div class="rocketstar-documents" aria-label="Complete design documents">
              <a class="rocketstar-design-link" href="/rocket-star/design/">Complete design <span>READ ↗</span></a>
              <a class="rocketstar-design-link" href="/downloads/rocketstar-complete-design-r1.0.zip" download>All appendices <span>ZIP ↓</span></a>
            </div>
            <p class="rocketstar-caption">R1.0 · 44 pages · 35 chapters · Japanese<br>Hardware, recovery and satellite service remain to be demonstrated.</p>
            <div class="rocketstar-funding"><span>First-flight funding</span><strong>In preparation</strong><span>Payments are not open yet.</span></div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="launch-meter" aria-hidden="true"><div><span id="launch-step">01 / RETURN</span><strong id="launch-altitude">GROUND</strong></div><div class="launch-track"><span id="launch-progress"></span></div><span>SCROLL TO EXPLORE</span></div>
        <nav class="launch-rail" aria-label="Explore rocketstar"><button type="button" class="is-active" aria-label="Reusable rocket" aria-current="step" data-scene="0"></button><button type="button" aria-label="Satellite connection" data-scene="1"></button><button type="button" aria-label="RockstarOS operations" data-scene="2"></button></nav>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="rocket-footer"><span>© 2026 avokadinc</span><a href="/rocket-star/design/">Complete product design</a><a href="/">avokado ↗</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
